title: "Jinx — AI-Agent Red-Team"
message: "If you use Jinx in your research, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: asadr00t
repository-code: "https://github.com/Asadsaf/Jinx-AI"
abstract: >-
  Jinx tests whether an AI agent or assistant can be made to leak data, cross a
  tenant boundary, or take an unauthorized action. Its technique library is
  organized by MITRE ATLAS, with one rule-based scorer that gates findings on
  real impact rather than content-only jailbreaks.
keywords:
  - security
  - red-team
  - ai-agent
  - prompt-injection
  - llm
  - mitre-atlas
license: MIT
